Package: lampcheck
Title: Data Quality Checks and Accessible Plotting Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lucian", "Rominiecki", , "lukerominiecki@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides lightweight tools for checking data quality before analysis and creating clear, accessible visualizations. The package supports exploratory data analysis by helping identify potential issues such as missing data and incomplete observations and by providing a custom ggplot2 theme.
